{
  "name": "dsh-hob",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "dsh-hob：Hob 项目总负责人预设，负责需求确认、方案规划、开发调度、执行跟踪与独立验收",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agent-preset",
    "assistant",
    "planning"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.18"
  },
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./preset/tools": {
      "types": "./lib/types/preset/tools.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/preset/tools.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "TERMINOLOGY.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "preset",
    "kit/README.md",
    "kit/INIT.md",
    "kit/templates",
    "kit/drafts",
    "kit/roles",
    "kit/parts"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json && npm run build:client && node scripts/write-build-stamp.mjs",
    "build:client": "tsdown --config tsdown.config.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit && tsc -p tsconfig.client.json --noEmit",
    "check:presets": "node scripts/check-preset-contracts.mjs",
    "check:config": "node scripts/check-config-face.mjs",
    "check:policy": "node scripts/check-session-policy.mjs",
    "check:hob-create": "node scripts/check-hob-create-ui.mjs",
    "check:hob-create-dom": "node scripts/check-hob-create-dom.mjs",
    "check:hob-gate": "node scripts/check-hob-unselected-gate.mjs",
    "check:stages-dom": "node scripts/check-stages-panel-dom.mjs",
    "check:tasks-progress": "node scripts/check-tasks-progress.mjs",
    "check:tasks-route-http": "node scripts/probe-tasks-route-http.mjs",
    "check:orch": "node scripts/check-orch-state.mjs",
    "check:client": "node scripts/check-client-deps.mjs",
    "check:gitignore": "node scripts/check-gitignore.mjs",
    "check:archive": "node scripts/check-archive-consistency.mjs",
    "check:rounds": "node scripts/check-rounds-records.mjs",
    "check:readings": "node scripts/check-readings-citable.mjs",
    "check:build": "node scripts/check-build-sync.mjs",
    "check:profile": "node scripts/check-profile-assembly.mjs --self-check && node scripts/check-profile-assembly.mjs",
    "check:selfwake": "node scripts/probe-selfwake-e2e.mjs --selftest && node scripts/probe-selfwake-e2e.mjs",
    "check:redeliver": "node scripts/check-redeliver.mjs",
    "check:experience": "node scripts/check-experience.mjs",
    "check:host": "node scripts/host-probe.mjs",
    "check:modules": "node scripts/module-independence-probe.mjs",
    "exp:next-id": "node scripts/next-experience-id.mjs",
    "check:all": "node scripts/check-all.mjs",
    "check:preflight": "node scripts/preflight.mjs",
    "check": "npm run check:all",
    "check:exec-progress": "node scripts/check-exec-progress.mjs",
    "gen:ledger": "node scripts/gen-ledger.mjs",
    "check:ledger": "node scripts/check-ledger.mjs",
    "check:convergence": "node scripts/check-convergence.mjs",
    "check:stages-route": "node scripts/check-stages-route.mjs",
    "check:meta-negctl": "node scripts/check-meta-negctl.mjs",
    "gen:preset-contract": "node scripts/gen-preset-contract.mjs",
    "check:workflow": "node scripts/check-workflow.mjs",
    "check:ledger-resources": "node scripts/check-ledger-resources.mjs",
    "check:effects": "node scripts/check-effects-queue.mjs",
    "check:handoff-effects": "node scripts/check-handoff-effects.mjs",
    "check:work-state": "node scripts/check-work-state.mjs"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.0.5",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives": "0.2.1-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-system-prompt": "0.2.1-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.1-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.5",
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "@types/react": "^19.0.0",
    "jsdom": "25.0.1",
    "react": "^19.0.0",
    "react-dom": "19.3.1",
    "tsdown": "^0.15.12",
    "typescript": "^5.9.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "//": [
        "第 1 项 = 插件本体（模块开关等）。",
        "第 2/3 项 = 两个 Agent 预设声明（M2）。",
        "⚠ 预设的 patch 文件必须**列在这里**（本插件包内相对路径），不要另外把",
        "  preset/dsh-hob 目录单独加进 profile 的 dsh.profile.bundles ——",
        "  那会让两个 patch 挂载两次，宿主 loader 因 entry id 重复而崩。",
        "⚠ 顺序有意义：本体在后两份之前，预设行引用本包 ./preset/tools 时包已解析。"
      ],
      "patch": [
        "./cordis.patch.yml",
        "./preset/dsh-hob/preset-dsh-hob.patch.yml"
      ]
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "//": [
        "⚠ inject 里只能列**在 client 模块图里有 client 半边的包**（即自己声明了",
        "  dsh.client 且 exports 里有 ./client 的包）。列一个没有 client 半边的包",
        "  ⇒ 那一条依赖在客户端**被静默忽略**：加载器是",
        "  `const dep = graphRows.get(packageName); if (dep !== void 0) await arrive(dep)`",
        "  （dsh-client-modules/lib/client.js:656-659）—— 找不到就跳过，**不报错**。",
        "  后果是**你以为声明了依赖，其实什么都没等到**：顺序不保证、且无任何提示。",
        "  （第 6 步实测发现并修正，见 E-61。）",
        "",
        "  具体：本插件 client 半边用到两个服务、由两个**不同的**包提供 ——",
        "    · slots       ← @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer（它 super(ctx,'slots')）",
        "    · configForms ← @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "  而 @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots **只有 host 半边**（无 ./client 导出、",
        "  无 dsh.client 声明）—— 它只是 slots 的**类型/契约**包，**不能**列在这里。",
        "",
        "  ⚠ 批 18（2026-10-09）新增一项（「新建会话默认」卡片要读宿主预设清单与模型目录）：",
        "    · ctx.remote.agentPresets.list()      ← 命名空间由 @deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes 的 client 半边挂载",
        "    · ctx.remote.session.modelCatalog()   ← 同上（同一个命名空间装配器）",
        "  两者的实际提供方都是 **@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes**（它 $mount 了",
        "  agentPresets / session / settings… 一批 Typert Remote 命名空间，见其 client.js 的",
        "  TYPERT_REMOTE 表）—— 所以**只需要列它**一条；`ctx.remote` 服务本身由",
        "  @deepseek-ai/dsh-api-gateway 提供，而 api-remotes 自己已经声明了那条 inject，",
        "  依赖链随之成立。",
        "  ⚠ 这里**没有**列 @deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller / dsh-agent-preset-registry：",
        "    它们是那两个 RPC 的**宿主**（host 半边）提供方，**没有** client 半边可供依赖",
        "    （实测：dsh.client 段为空、无 ./client 导出）⇒ 列了会被静默忽略（E-61）。",
        "  ⚠ 2026-10-29（四步主线 · 只验位置）新增一项：",
        "    @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right —— 它提供 ctx.sidebarRight（openTab）",
        "    与 ctx.sidebarRightTabs（标签类型注册）。实测该包 **有** dsh.client 段与",
        "    exports./client（lib/types/client/index.d.ts + lib/client.js）⇒ 可列入。",
        "    ⚠ 同族的 @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar（左栏外壳）**没有** client 半边声明在",
        "    本仓 inject 里 —— 我们只挂它的 sidebar.footer.action 槽，槽服务由 renderer 的",
        "    slots 提供，不需要等它本身到达（槽位缺席时 ctx.slots.inject 不注册、不报错）。"
      ],
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right"
      ]
    }
  }
}
